   "description": "\n<b>Expense States and\u00a0 Meaning</b> \n<br>\n1. New - Any newly added expense but still not submitted will be in new state.<br>\n2. Submit - The final state for expense records is called submitted. You can restrict which roles can submit an expense.\u00a0<br>\n3. Cancelled - Any submitted expense which now stands cancelled. <br>\n<b>Note </b>- As a best practice, expense records should not be changed once submitted.\u00a0 Incase you want to make a change to a submitted expense record, you can first cancel them and then create a new record.",
